# PROJECT RULES — LUXURY ECOM PLATFORM
version: 1.0.0
enforced_by: Codex

## Code Rules
- TypeScript strict mode. Zero `any`. Zero implicit returns.
- All async functions wrapped in asyncHandler utility.
- API shape always: { success, data, message, error? }
- File naming: kebab-case for files, PascalCase for components, camelCase for functions.
- No inline styles. All styling via Tailwind utility classes or CSS variables.
- No hardcoded strings. All copy lives in constants/copy.ts.
- No direct fetch() calls. All HTTP via the central lib/api.ts axios instance.
- Every component must have TypeScript props interface defined above it.
- Zod schema must exist for every form and every API request body.
- Never expose secrets to frontend. All signed operations go through server.

## Folder Rules
- Client pages → app/(shop)/
- Admin pages → app/(dashboard)/
- Shared UI primitives → components/ui/
- Business components → components/[feature]/
- Global state → store/[name]Store.ts
- API calls → hooks/use[Resource].ts (React Query)
- Types → types/[resource].types.ts
- Constants → constants/[name].ts

## Git Rules
- Commits follow Conventional Commits: feat|fix|chore|style|refactor|docs
- Never commit .env files
- Branch: main (prod) | dev (staging) | feature/* (work)

## Design Rules
- All colors must use CSS variables from globals.css. Never raw hex in JSX.
- All spacing must be on the 4px grid.
- All animations must reference the animation constants in lib/animations.ts.
- Mobile-first. Every component built for 375px first, then md, lg, xl.
- No layout shifts. All images must have explicit width + height or aspect-ratio.
- Skeleton loaders required for every async data component.
- Dark mode is the DEFAULT and ONLY mode for this brand.

## API Rules
- All routes prefixed /api/v1/
- Auth routes: rate limited to 5 req/min
- General routes: rate limited to 100 req/min
- Admin routes: require both JWT auth AND role permission check
- All file uploads: must go through signed Cloudinary upload
- No direct DB queries in controllers. All DB logic in services/.

## Security Rules
- Passwords: bcrypt rounds 12
- JWT access: 15 minutes expiry
- JWT refresh: 7 days, stored in httpOnly cookie, hash stored in Redis
- Never log sensitive data (passwords, tokens, card info)
- All user inputs sanitized before DB operations
- Helmet CSP enforced in production
